codex
The failure is now isolated: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<getpid>/exe`; Lean 4.22’s runtime hard-codes the latter, so both Lean and Lake fail before reading the project. I’ll use a minimal local compatibility shim that redirects only that exact `readlink` request to `/proc/self/exe`, record its source and hash, and rerun the unchanged trusted preflight.
apply patch
